From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nura rc4 displayport series <rc4-displayport@nura.invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: guacamole: enable DisplayPort alt mode video

Add USB-C DisplayPort output: the FSA4480 SBU/AUX switch on QUP0 SE4 with its
EN# pin, the DP controller enabled with two lanes, and the DisplayPort
alternate mode advertised on the PM8150B Type-C connector.

The node set is the one the stock 18821 device tree uses (fsa4480@42 on
qupv3_se4_i2c, fsa_usbc_ana_en on TLMM GPIO 100, sde_dp with two lanes), and it
matches the upstream sm8150-hdk.dts layout for the same SoC and PMIC, including
the altmode VDO and the SBU endpoint on port@2.

The DP HPD path itself needs no property: qcom_pmic_typec registers a DRM DP
HPD bridge on the connector node, and typec_displayport feeds it through
drm_connector_oob_hotplug_event().

This patch adds video only.  The DP audio link is a separate patch and is
disabled by default there, because an enabled DAI link whose codec never
registers defers the whole sound card.

Kept in a separate file so the video and audio parts can be reviewed and
dropped independently; sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi includes it.

Compiled as part of the rc4 integration with the kernel's own dtc: 0 errors and
no new warnings versus the unpatched tree.  Not booted on hardware.

Signed-off-by: Nura rc4 displayport series <rc4-displayport@nura.invalid>
Nura-Category: device-dt
Nura-Origin: nura rc4 displayport series (sm8150-hdk model)
Upstream-Status: n/a: guacamole DTS is not upstream
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-displayport.dtsi  | 83 ++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi         |  2 +
 2 files changed, 85 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-displayport.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-displayport.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5f2709d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-displayport.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,83 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
+/*
+ * DisplayPort Alt Mode for the OnePlus 7 Pro (guacamole), kernel v7.0.0-sm8150.
+ *
+ * USB-C DisplayPort output needs four things on top of the SoC description in
+ * sm8150.dtsi: the FSA4480 SBU/AUX switch on QUP0 SE4, that switch's enable
+ * pin, the DP controller enabled with two lanes (the other two carry USB3),
+ * and the DisplayPort alternate mode advertised on the PM8150B Type-C
+ * connector.  HPD then reaches the DP driver through the DRM HPD bridge that
+ * qcom_pmic_typec registers on the connector node; no extra property is
+ * needed for it.
+ *
+ * Stock references: arch/arm64/boot/dts/18821/sm8150-audio.dtsi fsa4480@42,
+ * sm8150-pinctrl.dtsi fsa_usbc_ana_en, guacamole_t0.dtsi sde_dp tuning.
+ * Mainline analogue for the same SoC and PMIC: sm8150-hdk.dts.
+ */
+
+#include <dt-bindings/gpio/gpio.h>
+#include <dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6afe.h>
+
+&tlmm {
+	/* FSA4480 EN# (active low) */
+	fsa_usbc_ana_en: fsa-usbc-ana-en-state {
+		pins = "gpio100";
+		function = "gpio";
+		drive-strength = <2>;
+		bias-disable;
+		output-low;
+	};
+};
+
+&i2c4 {
+	/*
+	 * FSA4480 USB-C SBU/AUX switch, next to the TFA9874 speaker amps.
+	 * The driver requests no interrupt, so EN# is held by the pinctrl
+	 * default state above.
+	 */
+	typec-mux@42 {
+		compatible = "fcs,fsa4480";
+		reg = <0x42>;
+		pinctrl-names = "default";
+		pinctrl-0 = <&fsa_usbc_ana_en>;
+		mode-switch;
+		orientation-switch;
+
+		port {
+			fsa4480_sbu_mux: endpoint {
+				remote-endpoint = <&pm8150b_sbu_mux_in>;
+			};
+		};
+	};
+};
+
+&mdss_dp {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+/* Two lanes: the DP+USB pin assignment carries USB3 on the other two. */
+&mdss_dp_out {
+	data-lanes = <0 1>;
+};
+
+&pm8150b_typec {
+	connector {
+		altmodes {
+			displayport {
+				svid = /bits/ 16 <0xff01>;
+				vdo = <0x00001c46>;
+			};
+		};
+
+		ports {
+			/* port@2 is the SBU pair, routed through the FSA4480 */
+			port@2 {
+				reg = <2>;
+
+				pm8150b_sbu_mux_in: endpoint {
+					remote-endpoint = <&fsa4480_sbu_mux>;
+				};
+			};
+		};
+	};
+};
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi
index a8c7805..aafda21 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi
@@ -660,3 +660,5 @@
 		led-max-microamp = <70000>;
 	};
 };
+
+#include "sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-displayport.dtsi"
-- 
